@startuml Deployment Diagram
!theme cerulean-outline
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

node "Development Machine" {
    node "Docker Container\n(urbia-clean)" as CONTAINER {
        artifact "Flask App" as FLASK
        artifact "Python 3.9" as PYTHON
        
        component "Application" {
            [Dashboard Web]
            [REST API]
            [Telemetry Generator]
            [SDN Controller]
        }
        
        database "In-Memory\nRepositories" as MEM_DB
    }
}

node "Client Browser" as BROWSER {
    [HTML/CSS/JS]
    [Leaflet Maps]
    [D3.js Visualizations]
}

cloud "Internet" {
    [OpenStreetMap\nTile Server] as OSM
}

node "Docker Host" as HOST {
    [Docker Engine]
    [Docker Compose]
}

' Connections
BROWSER --> FLASK : HTTP :5001
BROWSER --> OSM : HTTPS :443
FLASK --> MEM_DB : Read/Write
HOST --> CONTAINER : Manages
CONTAINER --> PYTHON : Runs on

note right of CONTAINER
  **Exposed Ports:**
  - 5001:5000 (Web/API)
  
  **Volumes:**
  - ./logs:/app/logs
  - ./config:/app/config
  
  **Environment:**
  - PYTHONPATH=/app
  - PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
end note

note right of FLASK
  **Services:**
  - Dashboard: /
  - API: /api/*
  - Analysis: /analysis
  - Topology: /network-topology
  - Docs: /api-docs
end note

note right of MEM_DB
  **Data Storage:**
  - 15 Sensors
  - 2 Gateways
  - Telemetry History (recent 100)
  - Routing Decisions (recent 50)
  - SDN Metrics (real-time)
end note

@enduml
